  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Subah gyaarah baje, coaching bunk karke tum mall pahunche, aur saamne Chachu khade the.",
      "start": 0.21,
      "end": 4.89,
      "startFrame": 6,
      "endFrame": 147
    },
    {
      "text": "Ghar mein sab sochte hain Chachu office jaate hain, par unki naukri, teen mahine pehle chali gayi.",
      "start": 4.89,
      "end": 9.465,
      "startFrame": 147,
      "endFrame": 284
    },
    {
      "text": "Nazrein mili, Chachu ne dheere se kaha, tu kuch mat bolna, main bhi kuch nahi bolunga.",
      "start": 9.63,
      "end": 13.665,
      "startFrame": 289,
      "endFrame": 410
    },
    {
      "text": "Usi raat dinner pe, Dadi boli, mera beta roz office jaata hai, aur pota roz coaching.",
      "start": 13.83,
      "end": 18.915,
      "startFrame": 415,
      "endFrame": 567
    },
    {
      "text": "Tabhi Papa ne poocha, aaj coaching mein kya padhaya?",
      "start": 19.11,
      "end": 21.23,
      "startFrame": 573,
      "endFrame": 637
    },
    {
      "text": "A, sirf apna sach bolo.",
      "start": 21.69,
      "end": 23.355,
      "startFrame": 651,
      "endFrame": 701
    },
    {
      "text": "B, dono ka sach bol do.",
      "start": 23.61,
      "end": 25.095,
      "startFrame": 708,
      "endFrame": 753
    },
    {
      "text": "C, chup raho, dono raaz rakho.",
      "start": 25.38,
      "end": 27.135,
      "startFrame": 761,
      "endFrame": 814
    },
    {
      "text": "D, Chachu ka raaz bolo, apna chhupao.",
      "start": 27.42,
      "end": 29.565,
      "startFrame": 823,
      "endFrame": 887
    },
    {
      "text": "Tum kya karoge? Comment karo, answer in the next reel, follow karo @yourhandle!",
      "start": 29.67,
      "end": 33.885,
      "startFrame": 890,
      "endFrame": 1017
    }
